<Legal title="Alpha privacy notice"><p>Last updated: 12 November 2026</p><p>Bursara is a product of Streak Technologies Ltd, Royal Road, Pointe aux Cannoniers, Grand Bay, Mauritius. Contact support@streaktechnologies.com or +230 215 2998 about this alpha or its data.</p><h2>Testing data</h2><p>The shared demonstration institution contains synthetic records and is accessible to other testers. Use fictional names, contacts and financial records throughout alpha testing. Do not enter personal student information, real payments or sensitive documents.</p><h2>Information processed</h2><p>The application stores institution settings, user login details, permissions, student and debtor records, courses, invoices, receipts, allocations and financial corrections. Support access sessions record the staff user, institution and entry and exit times. Hosting and application logs may include IP addresses, request times and errors for troubleshooting.</p><h2>Cookies and hosting</h2><p>The application uses essential session and security cookies to keep you signed in and protect forms. The website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages; the application runs on a separate Debian server. Bursara installs no advertising trackers.</p><h2>Optional fiscal module</h2><p>The Mauritius EBS module is disabled for the shared demonstration. When configured in a separate test institution, an explicit sandbox submission sends the prepared fiscal document to EBS Mauritius. API credentials are encrypted in the database and omitted from browser responses.</p><h2>Access and removal</h2><p>Contact support to request access to, correction of or removal of your alpha account and testing data. Alpha data may be reset during development. A production data processing agreement and retention policy will be established before onboarding real student data.</p></Legal>